      "value": "A workaround was also discussed on Discord. The shaking doesn't happen if you disable locomotion control. This prevents you from moving yourself with joysticks so make a toggle for it. Documentation: https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/state-behaviors#animator-locomotion-control",
